LangString CheckNet10Text ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Checking for .NET 10.0 Desktop Runtime..."
LangString Net10NotFoundText ${LANG_ENGLISH} ".NET 10.0 Desktop Runtime not found. Downloading..."
LangString Net10DownloadAltText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "BITS download failed. Attempting alternative download using curl..."
LangString Net10DownloadFailedText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Failed to download .NET 10.0 Desktop Runtime. Please install it manually from https://dotnet.microsoft.com/"
LangString Net10InstallingText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing .NET 10.0 Desktop Runtime silently..."
